import H0mework.Physics.CartanGeneration.SecondJetLocalActualLift

/-!
# S9-C3h135: whole-slice Cartan second-jet development

C3h133 generates a complete local second-jet actual at every matching spatial
contact.  This module assembles those local outputs into a whole Cauchy
development before defining any response:

```text
source + generated current primitive
→ matching local C3h133 actuals
→ canonical time restriction at every spatial contact
→ whole-slice primitive U₂(t)
→ complete ten-field synchronized response of that same U₂.
```

Only the coframe and its derived `B = II⁺(e)` refine C3h128.  Every other
primitive field keeps the matching base-action path.  The coframe response is
now `v₀ + t a₀`, where both `v₀` and `a₀` were generated by the current
Cartan/action law.  No residual, response coordinate, endpoint, inverse image,
or supplied jet participates in the construction of `U₂`.
-/

